      "message": "From the commit message (which was rewritten)\n\nThis adds cpu pause APIs to the scheduler to pause and unpause\nCPUs. Pausing and unpausing a CPU can be used in place of hotplug.\nPausing and unpausing a CPU is faster than hotplug and can thus\nbe used to optimize the performance and power of multi-core CPUs.\n\nHopefully that is sufficient.  Please let me know otherwise.",
